{"chapter-slug":"rw8-14 N","paragraph":676,"wording":"[Wyvern Riders]","event":"named","holder-quote":"But she had not ordered it! She ran through the fortress in time to find Redscar. The Goblin snarled at her as his Redfangs mounted up. Across from him, the [Wyvern Riders] led by Snapjaw were doing the same.","id":"544631dc-423c-58a8-a1a7-72b7bdeec480"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-16","paragraph":1047,"wording":"[Wyvern Riders]","event":"named","holder-quote":"Badarrow was here, the leader of her archer squads, but Snapjaw was not. She was the head of [Wyvern Riders] now, having struck a connection with the huge, hungry beasts. Thanks to them, Goblinhome had mobility.","id":"b918852a-fd7c-555d-8963-df2dcd50f361"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-16","paragraph":1117,"wording":"[Wyvern Riders]","event":"named","holder-slug":"rags","holder-quote":"Rags shrugged. A little Cave Goblin she had known was apparently among their number, if Badarrow’s news from Ulvama was to be trusted. Rags would have already set out to rescue them, but the logistics of saving Goblins from that [Emperor] were dangerous. Still, she had [Wyvern Riders].","id":"c7dd3e03-7cf6-5a0d-bd13-412f3cf57c38"}
